# Phase 02 deployment policy: BYTE-FAITHFUL checkouts.
#
# MANIFEST.json pins sha256 over repository file bytes. Any EOL conversion
# (core.autocrlf) makes fresh clones hash-verify as stale on Windows.
# `-text` disables all EOL normalization: what is committed is what is
# checked out, on every platform. Blobs are LF; checkouts are byte-exact.
* -text
